    L212: 6.1 案例: Linear层TFLOPS只有300 (期望>700)
L215: Step 1: ncu确认kernel名
L217: → sm90_xmma_gemm_f16f16_f16f32_f32...
L219: Step 2: 详细profile
L223: Step 3: 检查输出
L224: 发现: Occupancy只有25% (期望>50%)
L225: Launch配置: blocks=32, threads=128
L226: 正常应该: blocks=132, threads=256
L228: Step 4: 根因
L229: shape是 [1, 4096] × [4096, 11008] → M=1!
L230: batch_size=1导致GEMM退化为GEMV
L231: GEMV的SOL天然很低
L233: Step 5: 解决
L234: 增大micro_batch_size, 或使用专用GEMV kernel
